      "text": "Good afternoon to everybody. The apologies from the Registry. We had some technical problems with the transcript and the screens, but I hope they are solved now. Before we call the next -- the witness to the courtroom, I would just like to indicate that we have received two translations of the documents P827 and P824. They have recently been admitted -- or marked for identification pending translation. Now they will be documents admitted into evidence. Now we should move into closed session so that we can hear the witness in closed session."
